        "Abstract": "Large language models are commonly trained on a mixture of filtered web data and curated 'high-quality' corpora. This paper introduces RefinedWeb, a high-quality five trillion tokens web-only English pre-training dataset. We demonstrate that properly filtered and deduplicated web data alone can lead to powerful models, outperforming models trained on The Pile. We publicly release a 600 billion tokens extract of RefinedWeb."
